<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31478" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔϊσος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ον <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span></span>, 
			Ep.
		 form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἶσος,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>alike, equal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, only fem. sg. and pl., always in set phrases (exc. [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππους]..σταφύλῃ ἐπὶ νῶτον ἐΐσας</span>”
				<i>equal in height,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.765
				</span></i>
			): </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> most freq. of
			a feast, <i>equal,</i> i.e. <i>equally shared, of which each
				partakes alike,</i> esp. of sacrificial feasts or of meals
			given to a stranger (for on other occasions the greatest men had the
			best portions), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαιτὸς ἐΐσης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.468
				</span></i>
			,al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> ofships,
				<i>even</i> or <i>well-balanced,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηὸς ἐΐσης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.729
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆες ἐῗσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.175
				</span></i>
			,al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of a
			shield, <i>evenly balanced,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπίδα πάντοσ᾽ ἐΐσην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					12.294
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				13.157
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				160
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> of the
			mind, <i>even, well-balanced,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρένας ἔνδον ἐΐσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					11.337
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				14.178
			</span></i>.</div>
